  "defect_observations": [
    "Owned body file lines 324-327: the array rows end in a single backslash instead of the row separator '\\\\'. The unit build stops at line 325 with 'Extra alignment tab has been changed to \\cr' (fatal, no PDF), so the Grinstead-Snell Exercise 8 table in the complement-test example does not typeset.",
    "The unit build also reports DurrettPTEAuthor2019 and GrinsteadSnellChance2006 as undefined. Biber failed on the malformed .bcf left by the fatal pdflatex error, so this is probably a side effect of the array error.",
    "Owned body chapter heading (line 3), 'Independent Families of Arbitrary Size and the Complement Test', differs from the packet chapter title 'Conditioning, Independence and Information'. The 159.2 section heading (line 265) differs from the packet title 'Pairwise independence, mutual independence and their different consequences'.",
    "handbook/parts/p15/independent-random-variables.tex line 17 cites [p.~53; exercises~2.1.2, 2.1.6, 2.1.9, 2.1.15]. Durrett p.53 (PDF 61) holds the finite construction. Exercise 2.1.2 is on p.54, exercises 2.1.6 and 2.1.9 are on p.55, and 2.1.15 is on p.56 (PDF 62-64). The exercises are cited by number, so this is only a page-precision note.",
    "Owned body lines 6-20 and 393-403 say that the arbitrary-index transfer, the infinite-choice boundary and the countability theorem are not presented in either source. They are new material, not restored source content."
  ],
